      "end": 307.44,
      "text": "lie. In fact, Iran responded by saying"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 145,
      "start": 305.84,
      "end": 309.12,
      "text": "that we have not had any conversation with Donald Trump."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 146,
      "start": 307.44,
      "end": 311.44,
      "text": "In fact, the US is"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 147,
      "start": 309.12,
      "end": 313.44,
      "text": "negotiating with itself. Now what happened after this was that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 148,
      "start": 311.44,
      "end": 315.919,
      "text": "after Donald Trump's post, the"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 149,
      "start": 313.44,
      "end": 318.32,
      "text": "crude oil prices which had immediately fallen by 15%"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 150,
      "start": 315.919,
      "end": 320.639,
      "text": "to $85, started rising again"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 151,
      "start": 318.32,
      "end": 322.16,
      "text": "and went to $92. In such a situation, the whole world"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 152,
      "start": 320.639,
      "end": 324.32,
      "text": "was in confusion mode as to what was happening"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 153,
      "start": 322.16,
      "end": 326.08,
      "text": "? After all, with whom is Donald Trump negotiating"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 154,
      "start": 324.32,
      "end": 328.479,
      "text": "? But later the truth comes out"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 155,
      "start": 326.08,
      "end": 330.479,
      "text": "that it was all a drama and nothing else. In"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 156,
      "start": 328.479,
      "end": 332.32,
      "text": "fact, Trump made this post so that"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 157,
      "start": 330.479,
      "end": 334.32,
      "text": "he could manipulate the market, especially crude oil,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 158,
      "start": 332.32,
      "end": 337.28,
      "text": "and there is ample evidence for this."
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 159,
      "start": 334.32,
      "end": 339.199,
      "text": "Look, Donald Trump posted this at 7:05 am"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 160,
      "start": 337.28,
      "end": 341.28,
      "text": "and interestingly,"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 161,
      "start": 339.199,
      "end": 343.919,
      "text": "just 15 minutes"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 162,
      "start": 341.28,
      "end": 345.52,
      "text": "before that, on 649, there was"
    },
    {
      "subtitle_id": 163,
